@startuml F5.9-D01-baixar-modelo-importacao
title F5.9-D01 — Baixar modelo de importação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ImportController" as Ctrl
participant "ImportTemplateUseCase" as UC

Sec -> WebApp: Baixar modelo alunos
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /importacoes/modelo?kind=alunos
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  schema + linha exemplo
  (sem MinIO)
end note
UC --> Ctrl: bytes
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 arquivo
WebApp --> Sec: download CSV

@enduml
